      "message": "fix: carry refusal names the setup's actual machine kind\n\nThe refusal said 'a lathe or mill-turn machine' for any non-mill setup,\nincluding a sinker EDM. carry_machine_refusal(kind) keeps the strict\nrefusal and the stable CARRY_MACHINE_REFUSAL prefix, naming the kind.\n\nFixes #1182\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
