      "message": "fix(setup): part-alignment refusal names the setup's machine kind\n\nThe aligned-setup refusal said \"a lathe or mill-turn machine\" for every\nnon-mill setup, including sinker and wire EDM. It now names the kind\nthrough the machine_kind_name table that #1182's carry refusal uses. The\nrefusal condition is unchanged.\n\nFixes #1230\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
